<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-SCHETT WINS WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SCHETT WINS WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>MARIA LANKOWITZ, Austria 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of final at the women's $107,500 Styria Open tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>5-Barbara Schett (Austria) beat 6-Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia) 3-6 6-2 6-3.</p>
</text>
